svg-editor 0.1 — type 'help' for commands
svg> init 800 600
canvas 800x600 created
svg> create rect bg 0 0 800 600 #ffffff
rect#bg created
svg> create text title 20 40 "My Diagram"
text#title created
svg> create circle c1 100 100 20 red
circle#c1 created
svg> create rect box 200 80 60 60 #3366ff
rect#box created
svg> group markers c1 box
g#markers created with 2 children
svg> tree
svg (800x600)
├── rect#bg  x=0 y=0 width=800 height=600
├── text#title  x=20 y=40 text="My Diagram"
└── g#markers
    ├── circle#c1  cx=100 cy=100 r=20
    └── rect#box  x=200 y=80 width=60 height=60
svg> move c1 30 0
circle#c1 moved to (130,100)
svg> undo
circle#c1 moved back to (100,100)
svg> redo
circle#c1 moved to (130,100)
svg> set title text "My Diagram v2"
text#title updated: text="My Diagram v2"
svg> undo
text#title updated: text="My Diagram"
svg> group bad c1 markers
error: cannot group a container into its own descendant: markers
svg> delete box
rect#box deleted
svg> undo
rect#box restored into g#markers
svg> save demo.svg
saved to demo.svg (5 elements)
svg> undo
error: undo not allowed after io command
svg> read other.svg
warning: assigned id rect1 to unnamed <rect>
warning: previous document discarded
read other.svg (7 elements)
svg> tree
svg (400x300)
├── rect#rect1  x=0 y=0 width=400 height=300
├── text#t1  x=10 y=290 text="imported"
├── circle#c1  cx=50 cy=50 r=10
├── g#g1
│   ├── rect#r2  x=0 y=0 width=10 height=10
│   └── circle#c2  cx=5 cy=5 r=2
└── ellipse#e1  cx=1 cy=2 rx=3 ry=4
svg> quit
